, "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:30:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Last", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:30:27Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "10. Because the war in Laos was technically illegal (violating the 1962 Geneva Accords on Laotian neutrality), the mission required a name that sounded somewhat routine or even like a training exercise. A \"X\" is a basic aerial combat maneuver. By choosing a common flight term, the Pentagon could hide the massive bombing campaign behind a name that sounded like standard pilot practice or a simple tactical movement. It allowed officials to discuss the operation in semi-public settings without immediately tipping off the press that they were conducting the most intense saturation bombing in history. What was the operation named?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:30:51Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Rolling Thunder?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:30:57Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Operation Hawai Phirki", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:31:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "barrel roll?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:31:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Thoda close toh hai", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:31:12Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Shane Warne?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]